{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Note:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game is currently less than 20% complete, with daily intensive updates. We aim to reach approximately 50% completion by the end of the New Product Festival.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to follow our subsequent updates ,<strong>but Try the game</strong> <strong>with caution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Version Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 complete stages of the first level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 types of Lucky Coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">72 winning symbols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 symbol materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 language (Simplified Chinese)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Daily Update Schedule:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 10</strong>: Enhance settlement performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 11</strong>: Add 30 new coins, item purchase, and symbol removal functions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 12</strong>: Add 50 new coins and 5 material types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 13</strong>: Expand lottery categories and introduce a lottery upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 14</strong>: Complete level design and contract system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 15</strong>: Adjust level parameters (initial full-game experience available)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 16</strong>: Add English language support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 17</strong>: Bug fixes and optimizations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Description of the gameplay in the trial version:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scratch-off Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789420/extras/image3.png?t=1750003037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traditional scratch-off gameplay: Scratch any non-numeric symbol to claim the bonus below it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Symbols</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789420/extras/image1.png?t=1750003037\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can purchase symbols from the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more symbols you have, the higher your chance of winning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Symbols have attributes (e.g., sports, Chinese characters, zodiac signs, etc.). Different symbols can \u8054\u52a8 (link with) different Lucky Coins to unlock higher rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Materials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789420/extras/image1.png?t=1750003037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are multiple ways to add materials to symbols:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Silver: Bonus +2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gold: Bonus +5</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lucky Coins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789420/extras/image4.png?t=1750003037\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After clearing each level, players can buy Lucky Coins from the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different Lucky Coins have different effects.</p></li></ul>","backgrou